---
source: crates/fauxfield/tests/cli.rs
expression: out
---
List and choose the color theme

Usage: fauxfield theme [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list  List the bundled and user themes
  set   Use a theme (writes `theme` in settings.toml)
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -q, --quiet     Suppress informational output
      --no-color  Disable coloured output (also honoured: the NO_COLOR environment variable)
  -h, --help      Print help
